  <Docs>
    <summary>Represents a texture that is owned and managed by a Graphite backend, wrapping the underlying native GPU texture object.</summary>
    <remarks><![CDATA[
## Remarks

This type wraps a native GPU texture object created by the underlying graphics API. Dispose the instance when it is no longer needed to release the native resources; disposing does not delete the wrapped GPU texture, which remains owned by the caller.
    ]]></remarks>
  </Docs>
